# Reference images used while building the game. Neither is loaded by
# the game at runtime, and the gametiles one is another studio's Play
# Store artwork, so it has no business being served from your domain.
#
# assets/radio/ is the exception: the radio fetches those files from the
# deployed site, so it is the one thing under assets/ that must go up.
assets/*
!assets/radio/
gametiles_*.jpg
README.md

# Database setup, not part of the game. Nothing secret in it, but it has
# no reason to be served from the site.
supabase/
